      "content": "As your lead consultant, I would advise against delaying further and fully endorse an immediate public commitment to these mandates to prevent the brand from being permanently framed as unethical.\n\nContinuing to hedge or claim neutrality is no longer a viable long-term strategy because the market now views hesitation as a fundamental failure of your values rather than a prudent business caution.\n\nThe only way to protect the brand moving forward is to decisively stand with your values and customers today, even if it is uncomfortable, because the cost of appearing cowardly is far greater than the short-term risk of over-committing.",
